# cms-auth-v2-client.js is injected into CMS Classic and runs in IE mode /
# document-mode 5 (old JScript). Prettier's default trailingComma: "all" adds
# trailing commas in object literals and call argument lists, which that engine
# rejects outright — "SCRIPT1028: Expected identifier, string or number" — so the
# whole file fails to parse and silently never runs. Keep it out of Prettier.
